 "hast": "\n<p>The <code>shadcn</code> CLI supports <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/api/packages.html#imports\">package imports</a>\nfor installing components, rewriting imports, and resolving third-party\nregistries.</p>\n<p>Package imports let you use private <code>#...</code> import aliases from your\n<code>package.json</code> instead of <code>compilerOptions.paths</code> in <code>tsconfig.json</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"example\">Example</h2>\n<p>You configure <code>imports</code> in your <code>package.json</code>:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">package.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;imports&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;#components/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/components/*.tsx&#x22;,\n    &#x22;#lib/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/lib/*.ts&#x22;,\n    &#x22;#hooks/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/hooks/*.ts&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"imports\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#components/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/components/*.tsx\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#lib/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/lib/*.ts\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#hooks/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/hooks/*.ts\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Then import generated components using <code>#...</code> specifiers:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import { Button } from &#x22;#components/ui/button&#x22;\nimport { cn } from &#x22;#lib/utils&#x22;\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"#components/ui/button\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { cn } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"#lib/utils\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Callout\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6&#x22;}]\"><p>Package import specifiers must start with <code>#</code>. Use TypeScript 5 or later with\n<code>moduleResolution: \"bundler\"</code> and <code>resolvePackageJsonImports: true</code>.</p></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"app\">App</h2>\n<p>For Next.js, Vite, and TanStack Start apps that install\ncomponents into the same workspace.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Steps\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><h3 id=\"configure-packagejson\">Configure <code>package.json</code></h3><p>Add imports for the shadcn/ui install targets.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">package.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;imports&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;#components/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/components/*.tsx&#x22;,\n    &#x22;#lib/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/lib/*.ts&#x22;,\n    &#x22;#hooks/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/hooks/*.ts&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"imports\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#components/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/components/*.tsx\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#lib/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/lib/*.ts\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#hooks/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/hooks/*.ts\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>If your app does not use a <code>src</code> directory, remove <code>src/</code> from the targets. For\nexample:</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">package.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;imports&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;#components/*&#x22;: &#x22;./components/*.tsx&#x22;,\n    &#x22;#lib/*&#x22;: &#x22;./lib/*.ts&#x22;,\n    &#x22;#hooks/*&#x22;: &#x22;./hooks/*.ts&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"imports\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#components/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./components/*.tsx\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#lib/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./lib/*.ts\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#hooks/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./hooks/*.ts\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><h3 id=\"configure-typescript\">Configure TypeScript</h3><p>Enable package import resolution.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">tsconfig.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;compilerOptions&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;moduleResolution&#x22;: &#x22;bundler&#x22;,\n    &#x22;resolvePackageJsonImports&#x22;: true\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"moduleResolution\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"bundler\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"resolvePackageJsonImports\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">true</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>You do not need <code>compilerOptions.paths</code> for these aliases.</p><h3 id=\"configure-componentsjson\">Configure <code>components.json</code></h3><p>Use the same <code>#...</code> roots in <code>components.json</code>.</p><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;aliases&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;components&#x22;: &#x22;#components&#x22;,\n    &#x22;ui&#x22;: &#x22;#components/ui&#x22;,\n    &#x22;lib&#x22;: &#x22;#lib&#x22;,\n    &#x22;hooks&#x22;: &#x22;#hooks&#x22;,\n    &#x22;utils&#x22;: &#x22;#lib/utils&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"aliases\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"components\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"#components\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"ui\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"#components/ui\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"lib\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"#lib\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"hooks\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"#hooks\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"utils\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"#lib/utils\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure><p>The <code>ui</code> alias uses <code>#components/ui</code>. It is still covered by the\n<code>#components/*</code> import in <code>package.json</code>.</p><p>The <code>utils</code> alias uses <code>#lib/utils</code>. It is covered by <code>#lib/*</code>, so you do not\nneed a separate <code>#utils</code> import.</p></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo\">Monorepo</h2>\n<p>In a monorepo, use package imports for files inside each package and package\nexports for files shared across workspaces.</p>\n<p>For an app workspace:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">apps/web/package.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;name&#x22;: &#x22;web&#x22;,\n  &#x22;private&#x22;: true,\n  &#x22;imports&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;#components/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/components/*.tsx&#x22;,\n    &#x22;#lib/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/lib/*.ts&#x22;,\n    &#x22;#hooks/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/hooks/*.ts&#x22;\n  },\n  &#x22;dependencies&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;@workspace/ui&#x22;: &#x22;workspace:*&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"web\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">true</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"imports\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#components/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/components/*.tsx\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#lib/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/lib/*.ts\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#hooks/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/hooks/*.ts\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  },</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"@workspace/ui\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"workspace:*\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">apps/web/components.