rk-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;imports&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;#components/*&#x22;: &#x22;./src/components/*.tsx&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"imports\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"#components/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./src/components/*.tsx\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>This generates imports without extensions:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"import { Button } from &#x22;#components/ui/button&#x22;\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { Button } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"#components/ui/button\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>If you use a target without the extension:</p